# Languages
unknown

# Lyric
[Verse 1]
The last note rings
Then the room remembers how to breathe
The silence after music
Is not empty, it is full
Full of every frequency
That just stopped sounding

[Verse 2]
The ear keeps listening
For three full seconds after
Phantom harmonics
The ghost of the final chord
Still resolving in the air

[Chorus]
The silence after is the song
The rest that means the piece is done
Not the absence of the music
But the music's memory
Playing in the hall
That hasn't learned it's over

[Verse 3]
The drummer's sticks are still
The pianist's hands are down
But something in the room
Hasn't finished its cadence
The overtones decay
Into the shape of listening

[Bridge]
Every concert ends in negative space
Every symphony concludes in rest
The final bar line is a doorway
Not a wall

[Outro]
The silence after
Is where the audience becomes
The instrument<|endoftext|>
